abstract: >
  This repository provides the complete workflow to install, patch, configure
  and run the 5G NR urban vehicular simulation environment used by the FUMD-AI
  project to generate synthetic network performance data for AI-based handover
  prediction. The simulation combines OMNeT++ 6.3.0, Simu5G 1.4.4, INET 4.5.4,
  Veins 5.3.1, and SUMO 1.22.0, modelling 9 NR gNodeBs in the Alicante city
  centre with SUMO-driven vehicle mobility.
